  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appraisal of Danish Support to the UNEP Copenhagen Climate Centre (2022-2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the appraisal is to assess the priorities of the new UNEP CCC and operational management set-up as well as provide quality assurance of the project documentation in the form of an appraisal report with recommendations for the finalization of the documentation for the proposed Danish support to the UNEP-CCC before presentation to the Council for Development Policy.</narrative>
